@startuml
title Runtime: User Views Active Trips Dashboard with Updates
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "End User" as User
participant "Web/Mobile App" as UI
participant "API Gateway" as APIGW
participant "BFF Service" as BFF
participant "Trip Management Service" as TM
database "Road Warrior Database" as DB
queue "Message Broker" as MB
participant "Reservation Ingestion Service" as RI
participant "Agency Interface System" as AIS
participant "Notification Service" as NS

User -> UI: Request Active Trips Dashboard
UI -> APIGW: GET /api/v1/trips/active
APIGW -> BFF: GET /bff/trips/active (authenticated)
BFF -> TM: GET /trips/active (fetch aggregated trip data)
TM -> DB: Query active trips and reservations
DB --> TM: Return trip/reservation data
TM --> BFF: Aggregated trip data
BFF --> APIGW: Formatted trip data for UI
APIGW --> UI: Display trip data
UI --> User: Display Active Trips Dashboard

' Asynchronous update flow
AIS -> MB: Publish ReservationUpdated event
MB -> RI: Consume ReservationUpdated event
RI -> DB: Update reservation details
RI -> TM: Notify TripUpdate event (internal)
TM -> DB: Re-evaluate trip grouping/status (if needed)
TM -> MB: Publish TripDashboardUpdate event
MB -> NS: Consume TripDashboardUpdate event
NS -> UI: Push real-time update (WebSocket)
UI --> User: Reflect updated reservation on dashboard
@enduml